    "recommendations": "Ensuring that the single driveway entry point is clearly marked and visible from the access road could improve initial response times and navigation for arriving units. Given the length of the driveway, designating a staging area near the front of the property may assist apparatus positioning and support coordination between multiple responding units. Trimming or managing dense vegetation along the driveway corridor could enhance visibility and maneuvering clearance for larger emergency vehicles. Addressing limited rear access by identifying or maintaining any available pedestrian walkways as secondary movement routes for personnel may support ground-level operations around the structure."
